      "mr_id": "scipy-bvp-poisson-source-superposition",
      "sut_name": "scipy-bvp-poisson-1d",
      "display_name": "SciPy BVP 1D Poisson — ScaleSource (linearity)",
      "description": "Superposition / linearity MP_mono: the 1D Poisson equation -u'' = f is linear in the source f. Scaling f by factor > 1 must strictly increase the peak amplitude u_max — analytically by exactly the same factor — even when the integrator is SciPy's adaptive solve_bvp.",
